# App essentials

Working copy of the Software Product Essentials printable checklist.
Copy to `.devcentr/checklists/app-essentials.cmk` (do not edit this template in place).
Progress is recorded in `app-essentials.cmk.checks/state.json5` — do not rewrite markers here for checkoff.

Markers in this file are defaults for weave when no sidecar entry exists.
Stable ids: trailing `{id="…"}` — agents update the sidecar by id.

## Shared

::: checklist [type="progress" id="shared"]
[ ] Marketing version defined {id="shared.marketing-version"}
[ ] Build id stamped at compile/CI time {id="shared.build-id"}
[ ] Channel stamped (stable / beta / …) {id="shared.channel"}
[ ] Changelog + README entry points {id="shared.changelog-readme"}
[ ] CI builds release artifacts on tags {id="shared.ci-release-artifacts"}
[ ] Checksums (and signatures when required) published {id="shared.checksums-signatures"}
[ ] Secrets redacted from logs/dumps by default {id="shared.secrets-redacted"}
[ ] Support doc: what users should attach {id="shared.support-attach"}
:::

## GUI

::: checklist [type="progress" id="gui"]
[ ] About dialog with version + build id {id="gui.about"}
[ ] Help entry (docs + report issue) {id="gui.help"}
[ ] Debug dump button {id="gui.debug-dump"}
[ ] Open logs folder {id="gui.open-logs"}
[ ] Desktop and/or mobile class template triaged {id="gui.class-template-triaged"}
[ ] Windows installer signed + uninstallable {id="gui.windows-installer"}
[ ] Auto-update or Store/winget/pkg updates on each desktop OS {id="gui.auto-update"}
[ ] Update status visible in About {id="gui.update-status"}
:::

## CLI / TUI

::: checklist [type="progress" id="cli-tui"]
[ ] --version includes build id {id="cli.version-build-id"}
[ ] doctor or debug-dump command {id="cli.doctor"}
[ ] Package manager or documented install {id="cli.package-install"}
[ ] Self-update disableable if present {id="cli.self-update-disable"}
[ ] TUI: in-app About/help keybind {id="tui.about-help"}
:::

## Library

::: checklist [type="progress" id="library"]
[ ] Registry publish on tag {id="lib.registry-publish"}
[ ] SemVer policy + changelog {id="lib.semver-changelog"}
[ ] Support matrix documented {id="lib.support-matrix"}
[ ] Migration notes on breaks {id="lib.migration-notes"}
:::

## Game

::: checklist [type="progress" id="game"]
[ ] Client + content versions visible {id="game.versions-visible"}
[ ] Crash/log export {id="game.crash-export"}
[ ] Store/channel update verified {id="game.store-update"}
:::

## Service

::: checklist [type="progress" id="service"]
[ ] /health or /version includes build id {id="svc.health-version"}
[ ] Auth-gated diagnostics {id="svc.auth-diagnostics"}
[ ] Rollback-tested deploy {id="svc.rollback"}
[ ] Runbook linked {id="svc.runbook"}
:::
